te and delays."},"controlledInstallation":{"title":"Controlled Installation","description":"Execution follows coordinated sequences, technical details, and inspection-based quality control."},"finalVerification":{"title":"Final Verification","description":"The delivered system is checked against execution quality, waterproofing details, and project requirements."}}},"caseStudies":{"eyebrow":"Project Proof","title":"Case studies with measurable engineering context","cta":"Explore Proven Projects","challenge":"Challenge","engineeringDecision":"Engineering Decision","measuredResult":"Measured Result"},"comparison":{"title":"Supply-Only vs Engineering-Controlled Execution","columns":{"supplyOnly":"Typical Supply-Only Approach","sipanel":"SIPANEL Engineering-Controlled Approach"},"points":{"panelSelection":{"label":"Panel selection","typical":"Panel type may be selected mainly from availability or price, with limited review of site constraints.","sipanel":"Panel selection is checked against building use, roof geometry, insulation needs, and execution risk."},"waterproofingResponsibility":{"label":"Waterproofing responsibility","typical":"Waterproofing details may be left to site interpretation during installation.","sipanel":"Drainage, flashing, overlap, and sealing logic are coordinated before execution to reduce leakage risk."},"materialWaste":{"label":"Material waste","typical":"Quantities can be ordered before panel layout and accessory coordination are fully resolved.","sipanel":"Procurement follows coordinated layouts and material planning to support waste control."},"installationCoordination":{"label":"Installation coordination","typical":"Installers may resolve sequence and alignment issues directly on site.","sipanel":"Installation follows planned sequencing, alignment checkpoints, and coordinated technical details."},"riskBeforeConstruction":{"label":"Risk before construction","typical":"Project risks often become visible after materials arrive or installation starts.","sipanel":"Key risks are reviewed before procurement so decisions can be controlled earlier."},"technicalDocumentation":{"label":"Technical documentation","typical":"Documentation may be limited to product information and basic installation guidance.","sipanel":"Shop drawings, details, and procurement logic support clearer responsibility during execution."}}},"resourcesPreview":{"title":"Technical Resources for Better Project Decisions","cta":"Download Engineering Resource","pending":"Resource file pending","types":{"guide":"Guide","checklist":"Checklist"},"cards":{"panelSelection":{"title":"Panel Selection Guide","description":"Understand panel type, core selection, thickness, joint logic, insulation needs, and project conditions before procurement."},"roofLeakage":{"title":"Roof Leakage Prevention Checklist","description":"Review slope, drainage, flashings, penetrations, gutters, and installation risk before roofing starts."},"shopDrawing":{"title":"Shop Drawing Review Guide","description":"Check panel layout, accessories, flashing logic, quantities, and execution coordination before installation."}}},"rfq":{"eyebrow":"Request Engineering Review","title":"Start Your Project With Confidence.","intro":"Send the project details SIPANEL needs to review envelope scope, system selection, procurement risk, and execution requirements.","backendPending":"Backend integration pending","stepsLabel":"RFQ form steps","steps":{"0":"Contact Details","1":"Project Scope","2":"Technical Details"},"fields":{"name":"Full Name","company":"Company","phone":"Phone","whatsapp":"WhatsApp","email":"Email","project_type":"Project Type","project_location":"Project Location","estimated_area":"Estimated Area","message":"Project Details","optional_file_upload":"Upload Drawing or Project File"},"projectTypes":{"sandwichPanel":"Sandwich Panel Systems","standingSeam":"Standing Seam & ZIP Tech Roofing","aluminiumCladding":"Aluminium Cladding & Covering","fullEnvelope":"Full Industrial Envel